# Line endings: LF in the repository and in checkouts. Upstream used CRLF until 2026-11-08 and is LF since; merging across
# that change needs -X ignore-cr-at-eol (or -X renormalize).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Patches stay byte-exact: they must match the line endings of the sources they apply to.
*.patch -text
